    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naŋ E-li-yaa nhial",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min go̱r Kuoth Nhial ɣöö naŋɛ E-li-yaa nhial kɛ ruɔth, E-li-yaa kɛnɛ Ɛ-li-cä tekɛ dup jiɛnkɛ kä Gil-gal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-li-yaa Ɛ-li-cä jiök i̱, “Dothni wa̱nɛ mi, la̱ŋä ni ji̱. Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ɣä jäk ni kä Beth-ɛl.” Duundɛ ɣöö cu Ɛ-li-cä wee, “Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial in tëk, kɛnɛ tëkdu, ɣän cä ji̱ bi päl.” Kä cukɛ wä kä Beth-ɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat göökni tin te kä Beth-ɛl ben kä Ɛ-li-cä, kä cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ŋäc i̱ jɛ ɛn walɛ bi Kuoth Nhial kuääru naŋ kä ji̱?” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Ŋa̱cä jɛ. /Cuarɛ ruac kɛ kui̱dɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
