            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-li-yaa Ɛ-li-cä jiök i̱, “Dothni ɛn wa̱nɛ, la̱ŋä ni ji̱. Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ɣä jäk ni kä Jɛ-ri-ko.” Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ wee, “Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial in tëk, kɛnɛ ciötdu ɣän cä ji̱ bi päl.” Kä cukɛ ben kä Jɛ-ri-ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat göökni tin te kä Jɛ-ri-ko ben kä Ɛ-li-cä, kä cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ŋäci jɛ ɛn walɛ bi Kuoth Nhial kuääru naŋ kä ji̱?” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Ŋa̱cä jɛ. /Cuarɛ ruac kɛ kui̱dɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-li-yaa jɛ jiök i̱, “Dothni ɛn wa̱nɛ mi, la̱ŋä ni ji̱. Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ɣä jäk ni kä Jɔr-dɛn.” Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ wee “Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial in tëk, kɛnɛ tëkdu, Ɣän cä ji̱ bi päl.” Kä cukɛ wä kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat göökni ti jiɛn dhieec wä bä, kä cukɛ cuɔ̱ŋ ɛ na̱n kä cu kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw cuɔ̱ŋ thok yier Jɔr-dɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-li-yaa bi̱i̱dɛ ka̱n, kä cuɛ rith, kä cuɛ pi̱ yɔ̱t, kä cu pi̱ rɔ da̱a̱k däär. Cu ti̱ti̱ wä kui̱c ɛmɛ kä cu tin kɔ̱ŋ wä kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ. Kä cu kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw jiɛth ko̱o̱tdä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cikɛ wä kui̱c cu E-li-yaa Ɛ-li-cä jiök i̱, “Thiec mɔ dëë lät kä ji̱ mɔ a /ka̱n ɣä ni naŋ kä ji̱.” Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä wee “La̱ŋä ni ji̱, a jekä buɔ̱m yieekädu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-li-yaa wee, “Ci thiec ni mi bum. Kä ŋotdɛ mi wi̱i̱ ɣä nɛn naŋkɛ ɣä kä ji̱, ba duŋdu. Kä mi /ci ɣä bi nɛn, /cɛ bia duŋdu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wäkɛ kä ruackɛ, nɛnɛ cu thurbil maac kɛnɛ jio̱o̱k maac kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw da̱a̱k. Kä cu E-li-yaa wä nhial kɛ ruɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä jɛ nɛn kä cuɛ wiee i̱, “Gua̱a̱r, gua̱a̱r! Thurbiɛɛli I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ jiöŋköörikɛ!” Kä /kenɛ jɛ nyɔk kɛ nën.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bieynikɛ rɛt kä rɛw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Guäl Ɛ-li-cä kɛ gua̱th E-li-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bi̱i̱ E-li-yaa min ci pɛ̈ɛ̈n kä jɛ kuany, kä cuɛ rɔ ri̱t cuɛ ben cuɔ̱ŋ thok yieer Jɔr-dɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bi̱i̱ E-li-yaa min ci pɛ̈ɛ̈n kä jɛ ka̱n, kä cuɛ pi̱ yɔ̱t wee i̱, “Kuoth Nhial a nikä Kuoth E-li-yaa?” Kä min cɛ pi̱ yɔ̱t cukɛ rɔ da̱a̱k cu ti̱ti̱ wä kui̱c ɛ mi kä cu ti̱ti̱ wä kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ. Kä cuɛ jiɛth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci dayömni göökni tin te kä Jɛ-ri-ko jɛ nɛn lotädiɛn, cukɛ wee, “Ci yiëë E-li-yaa jɛ nyuɔ̱ɔ̱r.” Kä cukɛ röm kɛ jɛ, kä cukɛ rɔ goŋ nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛnɛ, täämɛ te la̱a̱tku kɛ nɛy ti jiɛn dhieec ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m. Akɛ wä kuääru go̱r. Dɔ̱ŋ ci yiëë Kuɔth Nhial ɛ naŋ nhial kä cɛ wä yuɔr wuɔ̱thni päämni kiɛ rɛy löli.” Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä wee, “/Cuarɛ naath jäk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ com amäni min cɛ pöc, cuɛ wee, “Ja̱k ɛ kɛ.” Kä cukɛ nɛy ti jiɛn dhieec ja̱k. Cukɛ jɛ go̱r kɛ ni̱n diɔ̱k kä /ka̱nɛ jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ luny kä jɛ. Kä cieŋɛ kä Jɛ-ri-ko, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “/Ka̱n yɛ jiök ɛn ɣöö /cuarɛ wä?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuthni Ɛ-li-cä tin ga̱ykɛ naath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ wec Ɛ-li-cä jiök i̱, “Nɛnɛ kuäära, wec ɛ mi te guäth mi gɔaa, ce̱tkɛ mi guici jɛ mi. Duundɛ ɣöö jiäk pikɛ, kä /ci mundɛ ciɛk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee, “Nöŋɛ ɣä tuɔ̱k mi /ka̱n cam, kä muɔcɛ rɛydɛ milɛ.” Kä cua jɛ nöŋ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä rɛy waŋ mi lo̱ny pi̱kɛ kä cuɛ milɛ wä yuɔr thi̱n, kä cuɛ wee, “Nɛmɛ laarɛ Kuoth Nhial i̱ cä pi̱ jak kä gɔw, thilɛ lia̱a̱ mi bi rɔ nyɔk kɛ ben kiɛ gat mi bi bath thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
